## What is Workday OfficeConnect

Workday OfficeConnect is an Excel-based financial reporting tool that connects directly to Workday data. It enables finance teams to build live reports, budgets, and forecasts without manual data exports. This site documents how to configure, use, and troubleshoot OfficeConnect across its core feature areas.

